54 740 Td 
(ECP-2400 EMERGENCY COOLING PUMP SYSTEM - TECHNICAL MANUAL) Tj 
T* 
(Document ID: ECP-2400-OM-REV4 | Department: Industrial Fluid Dynamics) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(1. GENERAL SPECIFICATIONS AND PERFORMANCE) Tj 
T* 
(The Model ECP-2400 is an industrial emergency cooling pump skid designed for critical) Tj 
T* 
(heat exchange and thermal plant containment operations.) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(1.1 Operational Ratings) Tj 
T* 
(- Nominal operating speed: 2400 RPM \(direct drive synchronous coupling\).) Tj 
T* 
(- Maximum allowable operating pressure: 12.5 bar \(test pressure 18.75 bar\).) Tj 
T* 
(- Rated liquid flow rate: 350 L/min at nominal speed under standard ambient conditions.) Tj 
T* 
(- Maximum suction lift capability: 6.2 meters at sea level \(101.3 kPa barometric pressure\).) Tj 
T* 
(- Permissible particulate size in pumped media: maximum 0.5 mm non-abrasive suspended solids.) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(1.2 Skid Dimensions and Physical Characteristics) Tj 
T* 
(- Total skid assembly dry weight: 420 kg \(operating weight 465 kg with flooded casing\).) Tj 
T* 
(- Skid footprint dimensions: 1200 mm length by 800 mm width \(overall height 950 mm\).) Tj 
T* 
(- Suction flange diameter: DN80 PN16; Discharge flange diameter: DN50 PN16.) Tj 
T* 
ET
