54 740 Td 
(ECP-2400 EMERGENCY COOLING PUMP SYSTEM - MAINTENANCE & LUBRICATION) Tj 
T* 
(Document ID: ECP-2400-OM-REV4 | Section 2: Servicing Schedules) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(2. LUBRICATION, SEALS, AND MECHANICAL WEAR LIMITS) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(2.1 Lubricant Specifications) Tj 
T* 
(- Specified lubricant for bearing housings: ISO VG 46 synthetic gear and bearing oil.) Tj 
T* 
(- Oil reservoir capacity: 1.8 liters per bearing housing.) Tj 
T* 
(- Oil change interval: 2000 operating hours or annually, whichever occurs first.) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(2.2 Mechanical Seal and Alignment Inspection) Tj 
T* 
(- Primary mechanical seal assembly inspection interval: conduct inspection every 500 operating hours.) Tj 
T* 
(- Check seal faces for scorch marks, carbon deposit buildup, or elastomer deterioration.) Tj 
T* 
(- Shaft alignment checks: conduct laser or dial indicator alignment checks every 3 months) Tj 
T* 
(  or immediately following any major maintenance intervention or motor relocation.) Tj 
T* 
() Tj 
T* 
(2.3 Fastener Torques and Impeller Wear Rings) Tj 
T* 
(- Casing flange M16 assembly bolts: tighten sequentially in a cross-star pattern to 85 Nm.) Tj 
T* 
(- Impeller wear ring replacement schedule: inspect radial clearance annually. Wear rings) Tj 
T* 
(  must be replaced whenever the measured radial clearance exceeds 0.8 mm \(nominal clearance is 0.25 to 0.35 mm\).) Tj 
T* 
ET
endstream
